            <ArticleTitle>Abdominal surgical emergencies in the elderly.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>937-69</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The evaluation of abdominal pain can be considerably more challenging in elderly patients. A higher likelihood of life-threatening pathology combined with a myriad of diagnostic pitfalls in this population mandate a more cautious approach with greater use of diagnostic resources and specialist consultation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
